  "description": "Find the number of subarrays with exactly k distinct integers using a sliding window approach.",
  "target": 2,
  "pseudocode": "1: function atMostK(nums, k) {\n2:   let count = {}, left = 0, res = 0;\n3:   for (let right = 0; right < nums.length; right++) {\n4:     if (!count[nums[right]]) k--;\n5:     count[nums[right]] = (count[nums[right]] || 0) + 1;\n6:     while (k < 0) {\n7:       count[nums[left]]--;\n8:       if (count[nums[left]] === 0) k++;\n9:       left++;\n10:    }\n11:    res += right - left + 1;\n12:  }\n13:  return res;\n14: }",
